# OAuth client credentials.
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and export before building/running the daemon:
#   set -a && . ./.env && set +a && cargo build -p asale-daemon
#
# Read at *compile* time (baked in via option_env!) and again at *run* time,
# where they override whatever was baked in.

# Gemini — google-gemini/gemini-cli installed-app credentials. Required for
# Gemini OAuth login; the provider is disabled when either value is missing.
# Values are published in the gemini-cli source; they are not stored in this
# repo because GitHub push protection rejects committed OAuth secrets.
ASALE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID_GEMINI=
ASALE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET_GEMINI=

# Claude / Codex — optional overrides; public defaults ship in daemon/src/oauth.rs.
#ASALE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID_CLAUDE=
#ASALE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID_CODEX=
